{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-17-1","title":"Proverbs 17:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>15:17; Ps 37:16 an house. 7:14 sacrifices. or, good cheer. with. 21:9,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-2","title":"Proverbs 17:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>wise. 11:29; 14:35; Ge 24:4-67; Ec 4:13 that. 10:5; 19:26; 29:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-3","title":"Proverbs 17:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>27:21; Ps 26:2; 66:10; Isa 48:10; Jer 17:10; Zec 13:9; Mal 3:2,3 1Pe 1:7; Re 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-4","title":"Proverbs 17:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>28:4; 1Sa 22:7-11; 1Ki 22:6-28; Isa 30:10; Jer 5:31; 2Ti 4:3,4 1Jo 4:5; Re 13:3-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-5","title":"Proverbs 17:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>mocketh. 14:21,31; Ps 69:9; 1Jo 3:17 and. 24:17,18; Job 31:29; Jer 17:16; Ob 1:11-13,16; Ro 12:15 unpunished. Heb. held innocent. 16:5; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-6","title":"Proverbs 17:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Children's. Ge 50:23; Job 42:16,17; Ps 127:3-5; 128:3-6 and the. Ex 3:14,15; 1Ki 11:12; 15:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-7","title":"Proverbs 17:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Excellent speech. Heb. A lip of excellency. 26:7; Ps 50:16,17; Mt 7:5 much. 16:10-13; 29:12; 2Sa 23:3; Job 34:12; Ps 101:3-5 lying lips. Heb. a lip of lying. 12:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-8","title":"Proverbs 17:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>gift. 23; Ps 18:16; 19:6; 21:13; 29:4; Ex 23:8; De 16:19 precious stone. Heb. stone of grace. whithersoever. Ge 33:9-11; 43:11; 1Sa 25:35; 2Sa 16:1-4; Mic 7:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-9","title":"Proverbs 17:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>that covereth. 10:12; Ps 32:1; 1Pe 4:8 seeketh. or, procureth. but. 16:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-10","title":"Proverbs 17:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>or, A reproof aweth more a wise man, than to strike a fool an hundred times.</p>\n<p>9:8,9; 13:1; 15:5; 19:25; 27:22; 29:19; Ps 141:5; Re 3:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-11","title":"Proverbs 17:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>2Sa 15:12; 16:5-9; 18:15,19; 20:1,22; 1Ki 2:24,25,31,46; Mt 21:41 Mt 22:7; Lu 19:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-12","title":"Proverbs 17:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>a bear. 28:15; 2Sa 17:8; 2Ki 2:24; Ho 13:8 rather. 27:3; Mt 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-13","title":"Proverbs 17:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>1Sa 24:17; 31:2,3; 2Sa 21:1-14; Ps 35:12; 38:20; 55:12-15; 109:4-13 Jer 18:20,21; Mt 27:5,25; Ro 12:17; 1Th 5:15; 1Pe 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-14","title":"Proverbs 17:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>beginning. 19; 26:21; 29:22; Jud 12:1-6; 2Sa 2:14-17; 19:41-43; 20:1-22 2Ch 10:14-16; 13:17; 25:17-24; 28:6 leave. 13:10; 14:29; 15:1; 16:32; 19:11; 20:3; 25:8; Ge 13:8,9; Jud 8:1-3 Ec 7:8,9; Mt 5:39-41; Ac 6:1-5; 15:2-21; Ro 12:18; 1Th 4:11 2Ti 2:23,24; Jas 3:14-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-15","title":"Proverbs 17:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>that justifieth. 24:23,24; Ex 23:7; 1Ki 21:13; Isa 5:23; 55:8,9; Eze 22:27-29 Am 5:7,12; 6:12; Lu 23:18-25; Ro 4:5; Jas 5:6 abomination. 6:16; 11:1; 15:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-16","title":"Proverbs 17:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>a price. 1:22,23; 8:4,5; 9:4-6; Isa 55:1-3; Ac 13:46; 2Co 6:1 seeing. 14:6; 18:15; 21:25,26; De 5:29; Ps 81:11-13; Ho 4:11; Joh 3:20 Ac 28:26,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-17","title":"Proverbs 17:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>18:24; 19:7; Ru 1:16; 1Sa 18:3; 19:2; 20:17; 23:16; 2Sa 1:26; 9:1-13 Es 4:14; Joh 15:13,14; Heb 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-18","title":"Proverbs 17:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>void. 6:1-5; 11:15; 20:16; 22:16,27 understanding. Heb. heart.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-19","title":"Proverbs 17:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>loveth. 14; 29:9,22; 2Co 12:20; Jas 1:20; 3:14-16 he that. 16:18; 18:12; 24:27; 1Sa 25:36-38; 2Sa 15:1; 1Ki 1:5; Jer 22:13-15 Da 4:20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-20","title":"Proverbs 17:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>He that hath a froward heart. Heb. The froward of heart. 3:32; 6:12-15; 8:13; Ps 18:26 and he. 10:10,14,31; 18:6,7; Ec 10:12; Jas 3:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-21","title":"Proverbs 17:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>that. 25; 10:1; 15:20; 19:13; Ge 26:34; 1Sa 2:32-35; 8:3; 2Sa 18:33 hath. 23:15,16; 2Co 2:3; Phm 1:19,20; 3Jo 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-22","title":"Proverbs 17:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>merry. 12:25; 15:13; 18:14; Ec 9:7-9; Ro 5:2-5 like a medicine. Heb. to a medicine. a broken. Ps 22:15; 32:3,4; 102:3-5; 2Co 2:7; 7:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-23","title":"Proverbs 17:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>8; 18:16; 21:14; Ex 23:8; De 16:19; 1Sa 8:3; 12:3; Isa 1:23 Eze 22:12; Mic 7:3; Mr 14:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-24","title":"Proverbs 17:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>before. 14:6; 15:14; Ec 2:14; 8:1; Joh 7:17 the eyes. 23:5; Ps 119:37; Ec 6:9; 1Jo 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-25","title":"Proverbs 17:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>10:1; 15:20; 19:13; 2Sa 13:1-22; Ec 2:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-26","title":"Proverbs 17:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>to punish. 15; 18:5; Ge 18:25 to strike. 2Sa 3:23-25,39; 16:7,8; 19:7; Job 34:18,19; Mic 5:1; Joh 18:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-27","title":"Proverbs 17:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>spareth. 10:19; 15:28; Jas 1:19; 3:2 an excellent spirit. or, a cool spirit. 16:32; Ec 9:17; Jas 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-17-28","title":"Proverbs 17:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>15:2; Job 13:5; Ec 5:3; 10:3,14</p>"}]}